What time do you think it is now


00:23:18.822 --> 00:23:21.022
I'm playing with my friends


00:23:21.372 --> 00:23:22.942
Friends


00:23:27.962 --> 00:23:30.112
He is this year's No. 1 in drag


00:23:30.132 --> 00:23:31.862
disturbed


00:23:31.962 --> 00:23:36.122
I'm his friend who played
with him all day today


00:23:36.172 --> 00:23:37.782
That's it...


00:23:37.802 --> 00:23:41.532
Sorry to keep you with him so late


00:23:41.552 --> 00:23:43.912
He smells so bad I'm cleaning him up


00:23:43.932 --> 00:23:46.412
It really stinks, why do you stink so much


00:23:46.432 --> 00:23:48.592
You should get used to it too


00:23:53.982 --> 00:23:57.392
I even prepare dinner for your friends


00:23:57.532 --> 00:23:59.102
good-good


00:24:00.162 --> 00:24:01.682
Very good


00:24:01.702 --> 00:24:03.272
Very good


00:24:08.712 --> 00:24:09.943
Thank you Pope


00:24:09.963 --> 00:24:12.192
Friends Program Succeeded


00:24:12.212 --> 00:24:13.692
Well, it worked


00:24:13.712 --> 00:24:16.192
Maybe I'm good at being friends


00:24:16.212 --> 00:24:17.913
Hmmm


00:24:30.442 --> 00:24:33.462
Roll up with a stick like this


00:24:34.073 --> 00:24:37.642
Then reshape


00:24:37.993 --> 00:24:40.352
Add a little decoration you like


00:24:41.532 --> 00:24:43.103
Done


00:24:44.452 --> 00:24:46.312
Try it for you


00:24:47.502 --> 00:24:49.063
Let's come together, little one


00:24:49.083 --> 00:24:50.402
It's Rubic


00:24:51.332 --> 00:24:53.993
Oh my god this is so hard


00:24:55.213 --> 00:24:57.402
Did Bruno say he was coming?


00:24:57.422 --> 00:25:00.662
Yes, he said he wanted
to create some memories


00:25:03.602 --> 00:25:06.373
Why does the smoke float up


00:25:06.393 --> 00:25:09.662
Yeah because it's hot


00:25:09.682 --> 00:25:10.963
Because it's hot


00:25:10.983 --> 00:25:16.423
If it's hot, the air will...
expand... and become lighter


00:25:17.532 --> 00:25:20.763
He doesn't seem to make
many friends at school


00:25:20.993 --> 00:25:26.143
Glass bead bracelets will help
Lubiqi move forward in the future


00:25:27.083 --> 00:25:28.563
Are you okay


00:25:28.583 --> 00:25:30.523
Mmmm much better


00:25:30.543 --> 00:25:34.483
Your astrology is accurate I'm very happy


00:25:35.463 --> 00:25:37.863
But my wife is sick


00:25:37.883 --> 00:25:40.323
Why does Bruno still hang out every night


00:25:40.343 --> 00:25:41.783
It's okay


00:25:41.803 --> 00:25:44.953
He works hard in the tailor shop


00:25:44.973 --> 00:25:47.583
You really have a belly


00:26:01.073 --> 00:26:04.223
This afternoon near Mandala intersection


00:26:04.243 --> 00:26:08.013
A suspicious man covered in trash appears


00:26:08.033 --> 00:26:12.603
The Emergency Management
Committee has issued a heresy alert


00:26:12.623 --> 00:26:16.113
If you find it, please report it immediately


00:26:16.133 --> 00:26:17.994
Repeat it again


00:26:27.353 --> 00:26:29.213
What's that


00:26:29.603 --> 00:26:31.794
Trash is moving


00:26:31.814 --> 00:26:34.213
so scary - scary


00:26:36.064 --> 00:26:39.383
Are these people your friends too


00:26:39.403 --> 00:26:43.014
We are the chimney sweep and his colleagues


00:26:43.074 --> 00:26:47.393
This is the garbage the
heretic interrogator is looking for


00:26:47.413 --> 00:26:49.064
Where did you find it


00:26:49.084 --> 00:26:51.523
Let's report quickly


00:26:52.164 --> 00:26:54.194
No I saved him


00:26:54.214 --> 00:26:56.313
Also named him "Pope"


00:26:56.333 --> 00:26:58.114
He is real


00:26:58.423 --> 00:26:59.864
It's so itchy


00:26:59.884 --> 00:27:01.453
Mr. Dan


00:27:07.224 --> 00:27:08.954
Ok let's go...


00:27:11.854 --> 00:27:14.294
Can he hide here?


00:27:14.314 --> 00:27:16.424
Like hiring him or something


00:27:18.693 --> 00:27:21.004
Your stupidity is really
inherited from your dad


00:27:21.024 --> 00:27:24.683
Would the customer want to ask
the trashman to clean up for him


00:27:24.994 --> 00:27:26.434
What is your relationship


00:27:27.784 --> 00:27:29.434
We are friends


00:27:31.284 --> 00:27:33.184
I can't make him work here


00:27:33.204 --> 00:27:34.144
Mr. Dan


00:27:34.164 --> 00:27:38.733
You go to work, I'll take care of the rest


00:27:38.754 --> 00:27:40.324
Go ahead


00:27:47.174 --> 00:27:48.624
Come with me


00:28:24.304 --> 00:28:26.534
They also have families


00:28:26.714 --> 00:28:30.084
It would be bad if they got targeted


00:28:36.144 --> 00:28:40.134
They're all rude and their work
clothes will break immediately


00:28:41.524 --> 00:28:45.724
It's a pity, I can still wear it if I sew it


00:28:47.865 --> 00:28:49.604
Learn how to use a sewing machine


00:28:50.995 --> 00:28:53.264
No one else will be seen here


00:28:53.284 --> 00:28:55.145
You live and work here


00:28:55.494 --> 00:28:58.314
I'll pay you first, spend it before it rots


00:28:59.795 --> 00:29:02.905
The owner here passed away a year ago


00:29:03.085 --> 00:29:04.654
You are free to use


00:29:04.674 --> 00:29:06.744
That...


00:29:07.714 --> 00:29:12.245
First time I saw that guy bring friends


00:29:12.265 --> 00:29:14.955
Thank you, trashman


00:29:16.395 --> 00:29:18.584
Ah, one more thing


00:29:18.604 --> 00:29:22.135
Cover your body with a cloth or the like


00:29:23.105 --> 00:29:24.554
I...


00:29:25.405 --> 00:29:27.385
I am afraid of monsters


00:29:28.115 --> 00:29:30.185
Really scared


00:29:42.255 --> 00:29:45.365
If you give it to Mr. Dan,
there will be no problem


00:30:13.325 --> 00:30:16.015
We caught heretics in the Udagawa area


00:30:16.035 --> 00:30:19.776
is a descendant of that astrologer


00:30:19.796 --> 00:30:21.945
She will be executed


00:30:22.505 --> 00:30:25.565
How long will this go on


00:30:25.585 --> 00:30:28.956
Heretics must be strictly banned


00:30:30.005 --> 00:30:32.245
Your ancestors...


00:30:32.555 --> 00:30:35.535
250 years guarding the land


00:30:35.555 --> 00:30:40.255
Our responsibility is to pass
it on to the next generation


00:30:47.195 --> 00:30:49.465
"The outside world" does not exist


00:30:49.485 --> 00:30:51.806
This is the world


00:30:54.455 --> 00:30:58.146
Anyone who conspires will be executed


00:30:58.166 --> 00:31:00.776
Wanted Garbage Man


00:31:10.465 --> 00:31:12.495
What is this


00:31:14.806 --> 00:31:17.495
Those are the pants I lost


00:31:17.846 --> 00:31:20.206
this is my shirt-my coat


00:31:20.226 --> 00:31:21.876
My


00:31:21.896 --> 00:31:23.465
Who made this up


00:31:25.316 --> 00:31:27.926
Pope what's that


00:31:28.106 --> 00:31:29.846
This is a cape


00:31:30.026 --> 00:31:32.515
I sewed it myself


00:31:32.535 --> 00:31:33.476
Those are also


00:31:33.495 --> 00:31:36.555
Mr. Dan offered me a job


00:31:36.615 --> 00:31:39.186
Working in a tailor shop
in an underground street


00:31:39.206 --> 00:31:40.896
The Tailor That's...


00:31:40.916 --> 00:31:43.436
Maybe I'm good at tailoring


00:31:43.456 --> 00:31:44.986
That's it


00:31:45.715 --> 00:31:49.236
Pope I'll show you where I work too


00:31:49.256 --> 00:31:50.986
Come sweep the chimney with me


00:31:51.006 --> 00:31:54.416
But if everyone sees it...


00:31:54.675 --> 00:31:57.206
It's okay I have a great idea


00:32:03.976 --> 00:32:05.466
I sneezed


00:32:06.026 --> 00:32:06.966
It's me...


00:32:06.986 --> 00:32:09.056
This is me too... ha chirp


00:32:13.736 --> 00:32:16.807
Lubich-Yes


00:32:17.787 --> 00:32:20.396
How was that trash man yesterday


00:32:20.416 --> 00:32:22.016
Mr. Dan gives him work...


00:32:22.036 --> 00:32:23.566
That's it


00:32:23.586 --> 00:32:26.897
The heretic inquisitor seems
to be looking for him everywhere


00:32:26.916 --> 00:32:29.236
Better not get involved with him


00:32:29.256 --> 00:32:32.656
- Rubich...
- Thank you for caring about me so much


00:32:32.676 --> 00:32:35.246
Is it here Lubiqi


00:32:35.847 --> 00:32:38.616
it's nothing please don't mind-rubic


00:32:38.636 --> 00:32:40.206
Lubich


00:32:41.346 --> 00:32:43.046
Is it here?


00:32:50.406 --> 00:32:51.927
No way...


00:32:52.486 --> 00:32:54.097
No way


00:32:54.446 --> 00:32:55.807
No way...


00:32:55.827 --> 00:32:56.967
Why


00:32:56.987 --> 00:33:01.226
Lubich, you shouldn't be afraid of heights


00:33:01.616 --> 00:33:04.316
You see you've been shaking


00:33:04.336 --> 00:33:05.987
I'm not shaking


00:33:08.127 --> 00:33:10.656
Don't look down


00:33:10.676 --> 00:33:14.696
I know it, be careful not to let things fall


00:33:14.716 --> 00:33:18.326
Have you ever let things fall?


00:33:18.516 --> 00:33:20.247
One exercise


00:33:20.267 --> 00:33:22.087
Hand exercises


00:33:22.307 --> 00:33:24.287
That's the exercise my dad gave me


00:33:24.307 --> 00:33:26.217
I lost it here


00:33:26.726 --> 00:33:31.137
Why so important Where to bring work?


00:33:31.317 --> 00:33:34.466
Sweeping the chimney doesn't
require any manual exercises


00:33:35.367 --> 00:33:37.937
It's too late to say this


00:33:48.586 --> 00:33:50.527
Great...


00:33:50.547 --> 00:33:52.606
Although I am afraid of heights


00:33:52.626 --> 00:33:56.277
But when you climb up, you
will feel very happy and excited


00:33:56.297 --> 00:33:59.666
Yeah I feel it now too


00:34:01.726 --> 00:34:06.706
But we can't climb higher than the chimney


00:34:06.726 --> 00:34:09.927
Do you know "The Star"?


00:34:10.277 --> 00:34:11.717
Stars


00:34:15.317 --> 00:34:17.427
On top of that smoke


00:34:17.827 --> 00:34:21.017
There are shining stars


00:34:21.037 --> 00:34:22.977
Really


00:34:23.617 --> 00:34:25.227
I'm not sure


00:34:26.247 --> 00:34:29.527
But I'm not sure the stars
don't exist either


00:34:30.257 --> 00:34:33.737
This is a fairy tale my dad made up


00:34:33.798 --> 00:34:36.367
Chimney Town is full of chimneys


00:34:36.387 --> 00:34:40.407
Smoke everywhere, always overhead


00:34:40.427 --> 00:34:42.788
Smoky because of black smoke


00:34:42.808 --> 00:34:45.117
Smoky from morning to night


00:34:45.137 --> 00:34:49.417
Everyone in Chimney Town
is trapped in black smoke


00:34:49.437 --> 00:34:52.127
Never seen a blue sky


00:34:52.147 --> 00:34:55.008
I have never seen a shining star


00:34:55.657 --> 00:34:58.267
This story is awesome


00:34:58.828 --> 00:35:01.517
Everyone said the same at the beginning


00:35:01.788 --> 00:35:03.888
In towns that forget their heads


00:35:03.908 --> 00:35:06.307
A man raised his head


00:35:06.327 --> 00:35:08.477
That guy is still doing this


00:35:08.497 --> 00:35:09.647
What a nonsense star...


00:35:10.368 --> 00:35:12.797
Hey Bruno, keep talking


00:35:12.878 --> 00:35:14.567
Beware of being targeted
by heretic interrogators


00:35:14.587 --> 00:35:16.407
Oh, here you are


00:35:16.427 --> 00:35:19.078
Sister-in-law, please
say something to him too


00:35:19.098 --> 00:35:21.868
If he wants to tell a story, let him tell it


00:35:21.888 --> 00:35:24.537
This couple is really alike


00:35:24.888 --> 00:35:27.038
That's why we got married


00:35:30.517 --> 00:35:32.208
In towns that forget their heads


00:35:32.228 --> 00:35:34.048
A man raised his head


00:35:34.068 --> 00:35:36.268
Looking at the black smoke
that enveloped the town,


00:35:36.288 --> 00:35:37.488
the man began to think...


00:35:38.818 --> 00:35:41.098
Nothing on it


00:35:41.118 --> 00:35:44.228
Recognize the reality, or you
will be useless when you grow up


00:35:48.118 --> 00:35:49.318
Hello


00:35:52.088 --> 00:35:55.818
It doesn't matter what you say about me


00:35:55.838 --> 00:35:58.697
But that kid's future...


00:35:58.717 --> 00:36:00.408
You are not qualified to decide


00:36:00.428 --> 00:36:01.617
Assholes beat people


00:36:01.637 --> 00:36:03.958
you liar-don't be too arrogant


00:36:04.428 --> 00:36:06.038
What's wrong


00:36:06.058 --> 00:36:08.038
As usual


00:36:08.598 --> 00:36:12.958
My little one's choice
has nothing to do with you


00:36:12.978 --> 00:36:14.548
git


00:36:14.568 --> 00:36:16.338
He's an idiot


00:36:16.358 --> 00:36:18.848
What a joke


00:36:20.158 --> 00:36:23.928
Damn I lost


00:36:23.948 --> 00:36:26.228
No chance of winning from the start


00:36:26.408 --> 00:36:31.568
It hurts... I made you laugh


00:36:33.839 --> 00:36:37.488
Open your hand and let me see the little one


00:36:40.548 --> 00:36:43.408
Those guys are going too far


00:36:43.428 --> 00:36:45.368
Dad, you stepped on it


00:36:54.859 --> 00:36:57.839
It's really big


00:36:57.859 --> 00:37:02.718
This is today's apology,
sorry for embarrassing you


00:37:07.538 --> 00:37:10.769
Doctor says symptoms are not getting better


00:37:12.169 --> 00:37:14.608
Don't worry, mom is strong


00:37:14.668 --> 00:37:17.398
The doctor says there is no cure


00:37:17.418 --> 00:37:20.779
Maybe there is medicine in the outside world


00:37:20.799 --> 00:37:22.578
look up


00:37:24.718 --> 00:37:27.789
If a star emerges from the smoke gap


00:37:27.809 --> 00:37:30.249
It will only be a moment


00:37:30.269 --> 00:37:33.959
If you miss that moment, you won't see it


00:37:33.979 --> 00:37:37.548
If you want to see the stars,
you can't miss that moment


00:37:37.568 --> 00:37:42.428
You must spend more
time looking up than others


00:37:42.448 --> 00:37:45.139
Keep believing


00:37:45.909 --> 00:37:47.518
If you look down


00:37:47.538 --> 00:37:51.688
Maybe I will miss my chance
to cure my mother


00:37:52.618 --> 00:37:55.688
It doesn't matter if no
one is paying attention


00:37:56.209 --> 00:38:00.648
As long as you believe that there
is light outside that black smoke


00:38:00.668 --> 00:38:03.658
Do it and feel it


00:38:03.678 --> 00:38:07.119
Don't succumb to common
sense, believe it to the end


00:38:07.139 --> 00:38:09.199
Even if it's just you


00:38:09.219 --> 00:38:11.329
Even if it's just you


00:38:11.349 --> 00:38:14.209
Be confident too and keep looking up


00:38:14.229 --> 00:38:18.629
At that time, there will be
partners looking up together


00:38:20.149 --> 00:38:21.929
aka "friend"


00:38:25.319 --> 00:38:29.019
What's beyond the smoke


00:38:30.999 --> 00:38:34.599
Don't tell everyone this
story, you will be laughed at


00:38:34.619 --> 00:38:36.979
Why I think it's great


00:38:36.999 --> 00:38:39.949
No, keep it confidential


00:38:46.089 --> 00:38:50.830
I have a hunch it's about to start


00:38:50.850 --> 00:38:54.119
The footsteps that can
ride the wind and waves


00:38:54.139 --> 00:39:00.679
I found you you are my friend


00:39:00.820 --> 00:39:05.840
Heartbeat gradually increases


00:39:05.860 --> 00:39:09.219
Feel like breaking everything


00:39:09.239 --> 00:39:15.559
I am not afraid of anything now


00:39:15.579 --> 00:39:19.269
Even if the world laughs at me


00:39:19.289 --> 00:39:24.160
I still believe


00:39:24.219 --> 00:39:29.289
Just the words


00:39:31.559 --> 00:39:36.709
Just this time


00:39:39.060 --> 00:39:41.749
From us to dreams


00:39:41.770 --> 00:39:46.850
The vowed night begins


00:39:47.739 --> 00:39:54.060
Everything will be a miracle


00:40:02.500 --> 00:40:04.609
It's so big


00:40:06.629 --> 00:40:08.950
Hey it's that guy


00:40:10.140 --> 00:40:12.500
Wait for me


00:40:16.310 --> 00:40:18.040
Hey trashman


00:40:18.230 --> 00:40:20.000
what are you doing


00:40:20.230 --> 00:40:21.709
Working...


00:40:21.729 --> 00:40:23.170
Work


00:40:23.190 --> 00:40:25.510
This looks like something Rubic would say


00:40:25.530 --> 00:40:28.090
Do you know Lubiqi?


00:40:28.110 --> 00:40:30.850
How about you? Are you someone Lubiqi knows?


00:40:30.870 --> 00:40:35.020
I'm not someone I know I'm his friend


00:40:35.040 --> 00:40:38.980
Hey... he still has time
to play with trash people


00:40:39.000 --> 00:40:42.110
I thought he was working
all day after his dad died


00:40:42.130 --> 00:40:43.570
dead


00:40:43.590 --> 00:40:47.030
Hey he didn't tell you, it
seems he doesn't know


00:40:47.050 --> 00:40:49.700
My grandpa saw it


00:40:50.010 --> 00:40:54.540
Bruno runs to the forbidden cliff


00:40:54.560 --> 00:40:58.210
Seeing another big wave
and disappearing into the sea...


00:40:58.230 --> 00:41:00.540
Monster figure


00:41:02.771 --> 00:41:04.750
Monster


00:41:04.771 --> 00:41:07.260
Bruno has disappeared since that night


00:41:07.280 --> 00:41:10.510
He must have fallen into the sea
drunk and was eaten by monsters


00:41:10.530 --> 00:41:13.720
I heard that he drinks until late every day


00:41:13.740 --> 00:41:15.690
He asked for it


00:41:16.540 --> 00:41:18.480
What time is this


00:41:18.500 --> 00:41:20.150
A year ago


00:41:20.420 --> 00:41:23.650
The owner here passed away a year ago


00:41:23.841 --> 00:41:26.610
It's so hard to just go
to work without my dad


00:41:26.710 --> 00:41:28.951
Why didn't he inherit the tailor shop


00:41:28.971 --> 00:41:30.410
It should be for money


00:41:30.430 --> 00:41:32.370
Chimney sweepers are well paid


00:41:32.390 --> 00:41:34.580
He wanted to see the stars


00:41:36.101 --> 00:41:39.041
Lubich is to see the stars


00:41:39.061 --> 00:41:41.211
Like his dad


00:41:41.231 --> 00:41:44.630
That's why he chose a place with a good view


00:41:44.650 --> 00:41:46.881
He is obviously afraid of heights


00:41:46.901 --> 00:41:50.761
Still climb the chimney every day


00:41:53.371 --> 00:41:54.931
That's funny


00:41:54.951 --> 00:41:58.560
You mean the stars in
Bruno's story are real or fake


00:41:58.580 --> 00:42:00.191
Yes no wrong


00:42:00.211 --> 00:42:04.111
I also want to watch the stars with Lubiqi


00:42:11.341 --> 00:42:13.740
How could there be stars


00:42:13.761 --> 00:42:17.291
Don't take fiction too seriously


00:42:17.311 --> 00:42:18.501
Wait Antonio


00:42:18.521 --> 00:42:22.131
Are you spreading
rumors to get us into trouble


00:42:22.811 --> 00:42:25.211
No stars at all


00:42:27.111 --> 00:42:31.051
don't fight -you're too
much, enough is enough


00:42:31.191 --> 00:42:34.181
As long as you are in
this world it will be polluted


00:42:36.201 --> 00:42:39.441
Go get eaten by monsters too


00:42:46.961 --> 00:42:50.111
Pope of Chimney Town


00:42:53.221 --> 00:42:55.701
He was here just now


00:42:56.181 --> 00:42:57.951
Then escaped


00:42:58.011 --> 00:43:01.421
Trash people talk about stars


00:43:01.561 --> 00:43:04.421
Also said to watch the stars with Lubiqi...


00:43:30.092 --> 00:43:31.571
What's wrong


00:43:32.211 --> 00:43:37.371
Mom, there seems to be
something in the smoke just now...


00:43:39.351 --> 00:43:42.371
Nothing, nothing


00:43:51.441 --> 00:43:54.681
Pope my sleeve is torn


00:44:01.162 --> 00:44:02.852
Is it Lubitz?


00:44:02.872 --> 00:44:04.521
Mr. Su


00:44:05.581 --> 00:44:07.272
It really is you


00:44:07.292 --> 00:44:11.402
Are you still playing with that trashman?


00:44:11.922 --> 00:44:15.362
Everyone's clothes are mended


00:44:15.382 --> 00:44:18.282
